<title>USA: Sterling House names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Sterling House names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling House Corp said Friday it has named Mark Ohlendorf chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately.</p>
<p>Most recently, Ohlendorf was vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer of Vitas Healthcare, a privately held, Miami-based hospice provider.</p>
<p>Ohlendorf succeeds Gail Knott, who was been named vice president of financial reporting.</p>
<p>Sterling House builds, owns, operates, manages and franchises assisted living residences.</p>
